    "/auth/exchange": {
      "post": {
        "description": "Trusted web server -> API key for an identity it already verified (Google OAuth).\n\nOff (404) unless ``auth_secret`` is set. The web server keeps the key in an encrypted\nhttpOnly cookie, so the browser never sees it. Every sign-in mints a fresh key.",
